### HealthSync AI Recommendation API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### Test: Check AI Service is Running
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai

### Test: Patient Signup (Save token for testing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "apatient@example.com",
  "username": "apatient",
  "password": "PatientPassword123!",
  "first_name": "Alice",
  "last_name": "Johnson",
  "middle_name": "Grace",
  "phone": "+2348098765432",
  "date_of_birth": "1990-05-20",
  "sex": "Female",
  "address": "Lagos, Nigeria",
  "role": "patient"
}

