### Test: AI Recommendation - Chest Pain Symptoms
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "symptoms": "I have been experiencing severe chest pain for the past 3 days. The pain is sharp and worsens when I breathe deeply. I also feel short of breath and have mild fever."
}

### Test: AI Recommendation - Child Fever with Rash
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "symptoms": "My 2-month-old baby has been running a fever for 5 days with a rash all over the body. The baby refuses to feed. Fever reduces with paracetamol but comes back after 4 hours."
}

### Test: AI Recommendation - Joint Pain and Stiffness
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "symptoms": "I have severe pain and stiffness in my knees and lower back for the past month. I was involved in a motorcycle accident 2 months ago. The pain is worse in the morning and improves slightly with movement."
}

### Test: AI Recommendation - Skin Issues
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "symptoms": "I have developed persistent itchy rashes on my face and neck for the past 2 weeks. The rashes are red and sometimes feel painful. They get worse after applying certain cosmetics."
}

### Test: Error - Missing Authorization Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "symptoms": "I have chest pain"
}

### Test: Error - Empty Symptoms
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "symptoms": ""
}

### Test: Error - Missing Symptoms Field
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/aiRecommendation
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "other_field": "some value"
}
